>>**GCD of two numbers (long long)**

```cpp
long long gcd(long long a,long long b)
{
    return std::gcd(a,b);
}
```

>>**GCD of a vector (long long)**

```cpp
long long gcd_vector(const vector<long long>&v)
{
    long long g=0;
    for(long long x:v){
        g=std::gcd(g,x);
    }
    return g;
}
```

>>**LCM of two numbers (long long)**

```cpp
long long lcm(long long a,long long b)
{
    return (a/std::gcd(a,b))*b;
}
```
